    <description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qupez9Ek1/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Qupez9Ek1/"><span>点此链接观看视频版本</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>去年，MEGA的前卫造型，让理想已经经历过一次舆论冲击；到了今年，“停车梗”又让他陷入了相似的处境</span></p><span></span><p><span>反观蔚来，李斌和沈斐的“双人组合”打法逐渐见效，而理想的李想，却似乎始终在舆论场上孤军奋战。</span></p><span></span><p><span>值得警惕的是，各种梗的流行、品牌的标签化，正在悄然重塑消费者对品牌的认知。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这局，理想要如何在产品、舆论之间找到平衡呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 从ICU到KTV，成功了么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 一个停车梗，杀伤力有多大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 李斌双打，李想单挑，谁更好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1378">22:58</a> 产品、价格与舆论的平衡之道</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜后期制作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>三一博士团队</span></p>]]></description>
